      "text": "Every (40.0 ~ 14.5) seconds, Rakan gains ((30 ~ 225) + (95% Ability Power)) Shield. Rakan's Attacks and Abilities against enemy champions reduce this Cooldown by 1 second. Lover's Leap - Xayah and Rakan can recall together.",
